        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion M3, Keystone Basket Grab Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis 17-1/2 inch Keystone Collection handleset from Fusion Hardware is made from solid brass. The uniquely shaped handle gives this single cylinder handleset an airiness that elevates it from the mundane to the stunningly beautiful. It is available with a matching lever for the interior trim or you can choose your own. Fusion hardware's Basket Grab handleset is good for doors 1-3/8 inches to 2 inches thick and is available for doors with either a 2-3/8 inch backset or a 2-3/4 inch backset.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Keystone Solid Brass Handleset Fusion M3:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Bump resistant cylinder.</li> \r\n<li>Solid brass SC1 keyway and 5 pin system with self lubricating solid brass plug & housing.</li>\r\n<li>High security strike.</li> \r\n<li>Reversible latch bolts for inside and outside swing.</li>\r\n<li>Minimal parts for easy installation.</li>\r\n<li>Matching latch, strike and screws for excellent appearance.</li>\r\n<li>Beveled interior screws with single slot for improved visual.</li>\r\n<li>No unsightly or difficult-to-inset set screws are used.</li>\r\n<li>Dual spring assist to eliminate \"knob wobble\" found in lesser products.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Fusion Basket Grab Door Entry Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Outside Plate Length: 17-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Plate Width: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Inside Plate Length: 9-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Inside Plate Width: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 5-1/2\" on center door boring.</li>\r\n<li>Center of latch bore to center of bottom thrubolt for handle:  8-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: 2-3/8\" and 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is operated by a key on the outside and a thumb turn on the inside while the handle underneath the deadbolt is operated by a thumb latch on the outside and either a knob or a lever on the inside.</li>\r\n<br>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> For looks only. They are non-locking and non-latching. They are used as a pull or to match trim.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The finish for the inside knob or lever you choose will match the outside finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
